cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CalfTwin-ReAct: A State-Coupled Agent Testbed for Dairy-Calf Digital Twins"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Saro
    given-names: Jan
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jenasin/calftwin-react"
abstract: >-
  A closed-loop simulation testbed in which a digital twin of a dairy calf is
  coupled to a hidden ground-truth physiological simulator through a faulty
  sensor layer and a fallible command path, used to measure when a reasoning
  agent improves on a digital shadow or a fixed-threshold controller. All data
  are synthetic.
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - precision livestock farming
  - ReAct agent
  - state estimation
  - value of information
